    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Working.</strong> <em>An eruption of impossible colour.</em></p>\n<p>Release a saturated wave. Each creature within 15 ft of the Elemental makes a Soul save (DC by tier); on a failure it takes 2d6 sephirotic damage and is Charmed by the Elemental for 1 round — it sees only beauty in the Elemental and can't attack it. A save negates both.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost.</strong> 2 Clarity, +1 Noise · action · 15-ft burst centred on the Elemental.</p>\n<p><em>Animal silhouettes briefly inhabit the landscape behind the targets — a unicorn, a kitten, a dolphin.</em></p>"
    }
